ven-names>G S</given-names></name></contrib></contrib-group><pub-date pub-type="epub"><day>01</day><month>05</month><year>2007</year></pub-date><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><day>07</day><month>05</month><year>2007</year></pub-date><volume>96</volume><issue>9</issue><fpage>1492</fpage><lpage>1492</lpage><copyright-statement>Copyright 2007, Cancer Research UK</copyright-statement><copyright-year>2007</copyright-year><permissions><copyright-holder>Cancer Research UK</copyright-holder></permissions></article-meta></front><body><p><bold>Correction to:</bold> <italic>British Journal of Cancer</italic> (2006) <bold>95</bold>, 1314&#x02013;1320. doi: <related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" id="N0x1c410c0N0x1d4aeb0" ext-link-type="doi" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="10.1038/6603457">10.1038/6603457</related-article> (published Corrigendum, <italic>British Journal of Cancer</italic> (2007) <bold>96</bold>, 534. doi: <related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" id="N0x1c410c0N0x1d4af10" ext-link-type="doi" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="10.1038/sj.bjc.6603601">10.1038/sj.bjc.6603601</related-article>).</p><p>Owing to a publishing error, the revised author listing for the above paper was incorrectly ordered. JY Shin should have been added as the fifth, and not final, author &#x02013; we are happy to correct this mistake. The complete and correct author listing is shown above.</p></body></article>